{"id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-simple-type-semantics.md","title":"简单类型的递归 CCC 解释","display":"df-simple-type-semantics — 简单类型的递归 CCC 解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"2","label":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","aliases":["16-df-simple-type-semantics","CCC semantics of simple types"],"display":"df-simple-type-semantics — 简单类型的递归 CCC 解释","depends_on":["[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]"],"source":"Definition 2.4.1 and Theorem 2.4.2, pp. 147–148 (PDF 167–168); recursive interpretation and equations locally expanded","review_status":"source-semantics-and-local-reconstruction","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-simple-type-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-simple-type-semantics</span><span>CCC semantics of simple types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-type-semantics — 简单类型的递归 CCC 解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 2.4.1 and Theorem 2.4.2, pp. 147–148 (PDF 167–168); recursive interpretation and equations locally expanded"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-semantics-and-local-reconstruction"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\">\\(\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\\)</span>、类型集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\)</span> 和良型简单类型判断采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</li>\n<li>候选模型记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\">\\(M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是集合编码范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 是指定的终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_\\mathcal C\">\\(1_\\mathcal C\\)</span>、终箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_X\">\\(!_X\\)</span>、二元积、投影、配对、指数、评价及其唯一转置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>，满足所引 CCC 泛性质。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>。常量候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_c\">\\(\\kappa_c\\)</span> 的源/靶以下文类型递归确定；使用前要求属于该 Hom 集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_M(\\sigma)\">\\(T_M(\\sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_M(\\Gamma)\">\\(I_M(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^M_{\\Gamma,i}\">\\(p^M_{\\Gamma,i}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g)\">\\(A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\">\\(E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\)</span> 是下文定义的类型、语境、投影、共同源箭头的元组及良型项解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf g=(g_i:X\\to T_M(\\gamma_i))_{i=1}^n\">\\(\\mathbf g=(g_i:X\\to T_M(\\gamma_i))_{i=1}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\)</span> 的论域使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是模型记录谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{CCCMod}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathbf{CCCMod}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是由该谓词指定的可定义类，不能当作集合或真类对象的集合量化域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_M(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(b),&amp;T_M(1)&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,\\\\\nT_M(\\sigma\\times\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\tau),&amp;T_M(\\sigma\\to\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\tau)^{T_M(\\sigma)}_\\Theta,\\\\\nI_M(())&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,&amp;I_M(\\Gamma,\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq I_M(\\Gamma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\sigma),\\\\\np^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&amp;\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i}\\circ\\pi_1\\quad(i\\in[n]),&amp;p^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_2,\\\\\nA^M_{()}()&amp;\\coloneqq!_X,&amp;A^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(\\mathbf g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g),h\\rangle_\\Theta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_M(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(b),&amp;T_M(1)&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,\\\\\nT_M(\\sigma\\times\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\tau),&amp;T_M(\\sigma\\to\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\tau)^{T_M(\\sigma)}_\\Theta,\\\\\nI_M(())&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,&amp;I_M(\\Gamma,\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq I_M(\\Gamma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\sigma),\\\\\np^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&amp;\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i}\\circ\\pi_1\\quad(i\\in[n]),&amp;p^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_2,\\\\\nA^M_{()}()&amp;\\coloneqq!_X,&amp;A^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(\\mathbf g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g),h\\rangle_\\Theta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall c\\in C\\ \\forall\\boldsymbol\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)\\Longrightarrow\n\\kappa_c\\in\\mathcal C(I_M(\\boldsymbol\\sigma),T_M(\\tau))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall c\\in C\\ \\forall\\boldsymbol\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)\\Longrightarrow\n\\kappa_c\\in\\mathcal C(I_M(\\boldsymbol\\sigma),T_M(\\tau))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\gamma_i}(x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i},&amp;E^M_{\\Gamma,1}(*)&amp;\\coloneqq!_{I_M(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))&amp;\\coloneqq\\kappa_c\\circ A^M_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}(E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1}(t_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_k}(t_k))\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\times\\tau}(\\langle t,u\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t),E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\rangle_\\Theta,\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_j}(\\pi_jt)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_j\\circ E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}(t)\\quad(j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(\\lambda_\\sigma v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Lambda_\\Theta(E^M_{(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\tau}(v)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(\\operatorname{app}(f,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_\\Theta\\circ\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(f),E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\rangle_\\Theta,\\\\\n⟦\\sigma⟧_M&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma),\\qquad\n⟦\\Gamma⟧_M\\coloneqq I_M(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\tau⟧_M\\coloneqq E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\gamma_i}(x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i},&amp;E^M_{\\Gamma,1}(*)&amp;\\coloneqq!_{I_M(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))&amp;\\coloneqq\\kappa_c\\circ A^M_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}(E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1}(t_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_k}(t_k))\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\times\\tau}(\\langle t,u\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t),E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\rangle_\\Theta,\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_j}(\\pi_jt)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_j\\circ E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}(t)\\quad(j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(\\lambda_\\sigma v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Lambda_\\Theta(E^M_{(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\tau}(v)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(\\operatorname{app}(f,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_\\Theta\\circ\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(f),E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t)\\rangle_\\Theta,\\\\\n⟦\\sigma⟧_M&amp;\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma),\\qquad\n⟦\\Gamma⟧_M\\coloneqq I_M(\\Gamma),\\qquad\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:\\tau⟧_M\\coloneqq E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\land\n\\forall(\\Gamma,t,u,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\quad E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u),\\\\\nM\\in\\mathbf{CCCMod}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\land\n\\forall(\\Gamma,t,u,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}\\quad E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u),\\\\\nM\\in\\mathbf{CCCMod}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau)\\Longrightarrow E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\in\\mathcal C(I_M(\\Gamma),T_M(\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau)\\Longrightarrow E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\in\\mathcal C(I_M(\\Gamma),T_M(\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 Definition2.4.1、Theorem2.4.2，pp.147–148（PDF167–168），用保持 CCC 结构的函子解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda1_\\times\">\\(\\lambda1_\\times\\)</span>；本页把对应的赋值解释完整展开。一般派生型常量与等式规格是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a> 明示的本地扩展。这里不要求模型是 Sets，也不把指数箭头误当作元素函数。</li>\n<li>λ 分支使用扩张语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\">\\((\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\)</span>，输入源恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_M(\\Gamma)\\times T_M(\\sigma)\">\\(I_M(\\Gamma)\\times T_M(\\sigma)\\)</span>，因此转置同型。所有递归按有限类型树、语境长度或项树高度进行。</li>\n<li>常量型属检查中的输入类型列表与结果类型均被显式量化；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)\\)</span> 因而都会触发对应 Hom 条件，不依赖游离的型属参数。</li>\n<li>类型唯一性按项树归纳，解释于是独立于类型推导的选择。代换引理为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_i}(s_i))\">\\(E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_i}(s_i))\\)</span>。变量、常量、积直接用配对泛性质；λ 分支用指数转置的自然性和弱化投影，应用分支用评价。该引理及每条 β/η 的可靠性在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"85c36bdc2628e3c0\" href=\"?note=85c36bdc2628e3c0\" title=\"16-thm-categorical-completeness\">16-thm-categorical-completeness</a> 使用。</li>\n<li>模型量词遍历集合编码的 CCC 记录，足以包含句法泛模型。没有把所有模型组成一个集合，也没有额外要求强正规化、相等判定性或语义全局元素的分离性质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、类型集 $\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$ 和良型简单类型判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、类型集 $\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$ 和良型简单类型判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition2.4.1、Theorem2.4.2，pp.147–148（PDF167–168），用保持 CCC 结构的函子解释 $\\lambda1_\\times$；本页把对应的赋值解释完整展开。一般派生型常量与等式规格是 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]] 明示的本地扩展。这里不要求模型是 Sets，也不把指数箭头误当作元素函数。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-categorical-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"85c36bdc2628e3c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"类型唯一性按项树归纳，解释于是独立于类型推导的选择。代换引理为 $E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_i}(s_i))$。变量、常量、积直接用配对泛性质；λ 分支用指数转置的自然性和弱化投影，应用分支用评价。该引理及每条 β/η 的可靠性在 [[16-thm-categorical-completeness]] 使用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"1_\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"!_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_c","display":false},{"tex":"T_M(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"I_M(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"p^M_{\\Gamma,i}","display":false},{"tex":"A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g)","display":false},{"tex":"E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf g=(g_i:X\\to T_M(\\gamma_i))_{i=1}^n","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{CCCMod}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_M(b)&\\coloneqq\\rho(b),&T_M(1)&\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,\\\\\nT_M(\\sigma\\times\\tau)&\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\tau),&T_M(\\sigma\\to\\tau)&\\coloneqq T_M(\\tau)^{T_M(\\sigma)}_\\Theta,\\\\\nI_M(())&\\coloneqq1_\\mathcal C,&I_M(\\Gamma,\\sigma)&\\coloneqq I_M(\\Gamma)\\times_\\Theta T_M(\\sigma),\\\\\np^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i}\\circ\\pi_1\\quad(i\\in[n]),&p^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&\\coloneqq\\pi_2,\\\\\nA^M_{()}()&\\coloneqq!_X,&A^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(\\mathbf g,h)&\\coloneqq\\langle A^M_\\Gamma(\\mathbf g),h\\rangle_\\Theta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CCCData}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\land\n\\forall c\\in C\\ \\forall\\boldsymbol\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)^{<\\omega}\\ \\forall\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)\\Longrightarrow\n\\kappa_c\\in\\mathcal C(I_M(\\boldsymbol\\sigma),T_M(\\tau))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\gamma_i}(x_i)&\\coloneqq p^M_{\\Gamma,i},&E^M_{\\Gamma,1}(*)&\\coloneqq!_{I_M(\\Gamma)},\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(c(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))&\\coloneqq\\kappa_c\\circ A^M_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}(E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1}(t_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_k}(t_k))\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\times\\tau}(\\langle t,u\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t),E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\rangle_\\Theta,\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_j}(\\pi_jt)&\\coloneqq\\pi_j\\circ E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2}(t)\\quad(j\\in\\{1,2\\}),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(\\lambda_\\sigma v)&\\coloneqq\\Lambda_\\Theta(E^M_{(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\tau}(v)),\\\\\nE^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(\\operatorname{app}(f,t))&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_\\Theta\\circ\\langle E^M_{\\Gamma,\\sigma\\to\\tau}(f),E^M_{\